1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:03,640
(Bernadette:)-How?
-In a bad way, very bad.

2
00:00:03,794 --> 00:00:04,934
(Raj:)Hey, guys.

3
00:00:05,095 --> 00:00:06,595
(Howard:)Whatever you hear tonight,
just remember I love you.

4
00:00:06,763 --> 00:00:07,903
Hey!

5
00:00:12,769 --> 00:00:15,649
(Raj:)Emily, these are my good
friends, Howard and Bernadette.

6
00:00:15,806 --> 00:00:17,786
(Raj:)-Guys, this is Emily.
-Nice to meet you.

7
00:00:17,941 --> 00:00:19,151
(Leonard:)-Hi.
-Hello.

8
00:00:19,309 --> 00:00:20,949
(Emily:)Have we met before?

9
00:00:22,979 --> 00:00:24,479
(Raj:)No.

10
00:00:25,415 --> 00:00:27,655
(Leonard:)I don't. ..
I don't... think so.

11
00:00:27,818 --> 00:00:29,298
(Emily:)You sure? You look familiar.

12
00:00:29,453 --> 00:00:31,663
(Howard:)Well, you sure don't.

13
00:00:31,822 --> 00:00:34,392
(Howard:)You I know,
you I know, you?

14
00:00:34,558 --> 00:00:36,558
(Howard:)Total stranger.

15
00:00:36,727 --> 00:00:40,767
(Howard:)Even if you had yummy candy,
I would not get in your van.

16
00:00:41,798 --> 00:00:43,748
(Emily:)Did you go to that spin class
on Green Street?

17
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,610
(Howard:)That must be it.

18
00:00:45,769 --> 00:00:48,009
(Raj:)Since when do you go to spin class?

19
00:00:48,338 --> 00:00:50,288
(Howard:)Wow. Now who doesn't listen?

20
00:00:52,976 --> 00:00:55,616
(Amy:)Sheldon, your food's getting cold.
What are you doing?

21
00:00:55,779 --> 00:00:59,789
(Sheldon:)Looking through my textbooks
for a new field of inquiry.

